# Summary

1. Γ is the Legendre transform of W.

2. δΓ/δφ_cl=−J; the vacuum is a stationary point of Γ.

3. Vertices of Γ are 1PI.

4. Γ'' is the inverse of the full connected propagator.

5. Renormalization conditions are statements about the low-momentum expansion of Γ.

